<div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col overflow-x-clip">
  <%= render 'shared/marketing_header' %>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-24 md:py-32 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Subtle background blob -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-white/40 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10 animate-fade-in"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-10">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable tracking-tight leading-[1.1] animate-fade-in-up">
        O seu trabalho, <br/>
        <span class="text-terracotta italic font-light">em um só lugar.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up-delay-1">
        Diga adeus ao caos das abas infinitas. SpecLine unifica seus documentos, quadros de tarefas e chats em um ambiente minimalista, desenhado para o foco profundo.
      </p>
      
      <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up-delay-2">
        <a href="/register" class="btn-primary text-lg px-8 py-3.5 w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group">
          Começar gratuitamente
          <svg class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Manifesto / Value Prop -->
  <section id="manifesto" class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-ink/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-ink-paper transition-colors duration-500">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable tracking-tight mb-4">A ferramenta dita o processo.</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed">
        Nós acreditamos que a fragmentação do trabalho destrói a produtividade. Quando suas tarefas estão em um software de cards, seus documentos numa wiki separada e suas conversas em um app de chat genérico, você passa mais tempo procurando informações do que realmente trabalhando. O SpecLine foi criado para resolver esse problema pela raiz.
        </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Grid -->
  <section id="features" class="bg-fable-dark dark:bg-ink-darker transition-colors duration-500 py-24 px-6 border-t border-ink/10 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable tracking-tight">Tudo que sua equipe precisa.</h2>
        <p class="text-xl font-sans text-ink-light dark:text-white/60">Quatro pilares fundamentais perfeitamente integrados.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        <!-- Docs -->
        <div class="card p-8 md:p-10 opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up-delay-1">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-sage/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-sage">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13"/><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17"/><line x1="10" x2="8" y1="9" y2="9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable mb-3">Documentos & Wiki</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Escreva e colabore em tempo real. Um editor focado que entende Markdown e formatação rica, livre de distrações visuais.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Kanban -->
        <div class="card p-8 md:p-10 opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up-delay-2">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-terracotta/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-terracotta">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="9" x2="9" y1="3" y2="21"/><path d="M14 8h.01"/><path d="M14 16h.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable mb-3">Gestão de Tarefas</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Quadros Kanban fluidos e listas poderosas. Arraste, solte e organize o fluxo da equipe, com métricas nativas de tempo.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Chat -->
        <div class="card p-8 md:p-10 opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up-delay-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-ink/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-ink dark:text-fable">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable mb-3">Comunicação Contextual</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Fóruns e chats dedicados por projeto. Chega de mensagens perdidas; a comunicação acontece junto do trabalho real.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Whiteboard -->
        <div class="card p-8 md:p-10 opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up-delay-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-sage/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-sage">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4 Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable mb-3">Quadros e Diagramas</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Esboce ideias, crie fluxogramas nativos com Mermaid.js ou mova post-its virtuais em nosso Whiteboard imersivo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Use Cases -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-ink/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-ink-paper transition-colors duration-500">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable tracking-tight">Onde o SpecLine brilha.</h2>
        <p class="text-xl font-sans text-ink-light dark:text-white/60">Construído para disciplinas que exigem alta concentração.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        <div class="card p-8 bg-fable-light dark:bg-white/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-terracotta/20 flex items-center justify-center text-terracotta font-bold">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"/><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"/><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable font-semibold">Engenharia</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Mantenha suas especificações técnicas (ADRs), diagramas Mermaid e o backlog de tarefas no mesmo contexto visual. Menos alternância de contexto significa mais tempo em flow.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card p-8 bg-fable-light dark:bg-white/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sage/20 flex items-center justify-center text-sage font-bold">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4 Z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable font-semibold">Produto & Design</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Centralize as especificações de produto, PRDs e wireframes. O chat contextual garante que as decisões de design não fiquem perdidas em canais de chat genéricos e esquecidos.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card p-8 bg-fable-light dark:bg-white/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-ink/10 flex items-center justify-center text-ink dark:text-fable font-bold">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M16 13H8"/><path d="M16 17H8"/><path d="M10 9H8"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable font-semibold">Gestão Ágil</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-ink-light dark:text-white/60 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Uma visão clara do andamento dos projetos. Aproxime a gestão das tarefas reais que a equipe está executando, sem a sobrecarga de ferramentas excessivamente complexas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-ink/10 dark:border-white/10 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif text-ink dark:text-fable tracking-tight">Pronto para recuperar seu foco?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl font-sans text-ink-light dark:text-white/60">Junte-se a equipes que já abandonaram o caos das múltiplas abas.</p>
      <a href="/register" class="inline-flex btn-primary text-lg px-8 py-4">Criar meu Workspace</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%= render 'shared/marketing_footer' %>
</div>
